      "content": "That makes sense, thanks. I think I'm ready to try a draft. Let's go with that angle you suggested. \n\nCan you write the first two paragraphs for me? Just try to weave those specific terms—of course, don't overdo it—into a narrative that shows I'm looking at the long-term sociological effects of these algorithms. I really need it to sound like a heavy-hitter researcher, not someone just trying to pass a filter.",
